    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24395" root="صغو and صغى" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَغْوٌ</span></b> : see the next preceding paragraph. [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هٰذَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ٱبْنُ صَغْوِكَ</span>, or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِغْوِكَ</span></b> , is a phrase similar to
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هذا ابن إِنْسِكَ</span>, meaning <i>This is thy chosen,</i> or
<i>special, friend</i> or <i>companion:</i> but perhaps postclassical.]

